Here is a complete Laravel database design (tables + migrations) for the booking system described in the user and business stories. It covers services, per-day opening hours, breaks and planned closures, appointments (including multi-person bookings), and configurable settings.

MIGRATION 1 — services
php artisan make:migration create_services_table

